ns makes fine punch.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.216100797,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.216071707,"realTimeFactor":0.08392263961165049,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":6,"text":"The box was thrown beside the parked truck.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.219781772,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.219766832,"realTimeFactor":0.08140065629629628,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":7,"text":"The hogs were fed chopped corn and garbage.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.214802576,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.214785096,"realTimeFactor":0.0753693249122807,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":8,"text":"Four hours of steady work faced us.","audioSeconds":2.55,"runSeconds":0.226901796,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.226763185,"realTimeFactor":0.08898109647058823,"finite":true,"samples":61200},{"index":9,"text":"A large size in stockings is hard to sell.","audioSeconds":3.05,"runSeconds":0.306318494,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.306164631,"realTimeFactor":0.1004322931147541,"finite":true,"samples":73200},{"index":10,"text":"The boy was there when the sun rose.","audioSeconds":2.4,"runSeconds":0.230761422,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.230622981,"realTimeFactor":0.0961505925,"finite":true,"samples":57600},{"index":11,"text":"A rod is used to catch pink salmon.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.265175687,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.265151377,"realTimeFactor":0.10101930933333333,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":12,"text":"The source of the huge river is the clear spring.","audioSeconds":3.1,"runSeconds":0.241749753,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.241732043,"realTimeFactor":0.07798379129032258,"finite":true,"samples":74400},{"index":13,"text":"Kick the ball straight and follow through.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.208926272,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.208910212,"realTimeFactor":0.08113641631067961,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":14,"text":"Help the woman get back to her feet.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.184014764,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.184000224,"realTimeFactor":0.0758823769072165,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":15,"text":"A pot of tea helps to pass the evening.","audioSeconds":2.65,"runSeconds":0.20539423,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.20537824,"realTimeFactor":0.0775072566037736,"finite":true,"samples":63600},{"index":16,"text":"Smoky fires lack flame and heat.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.21300151,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.2129643,"realTimeFactor":0.08271903300970873,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":17,"text":"The soft cushion broke the man's fall.","audioSeconds":2.55,"runSeconds":0.206794114,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.206778153,"realTimeFactor":0.08109573098039216,"finite":true,"samples":61200},{"index":18,"text":"The salt breeze came across from the sea.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.206660632,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.206644722,"realTimeFactor":0.07872785980952382,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":19,"text":"The girl at the booth sold fifty bonds.","audioSeconds":2.65,"runSeconds":0.214510984,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.214491184,"realTimeFactor":0.08094754113207547,"finite":true,"samples":63600},{"index":20,"text":"The small pup gnawed a hole in the sock.","audioSeconds":2.525,"runSeconds":0.20428814,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.204266289,"realTimeFactor":0.08090619405940595,"finite":true,"samples":60600},{"index":21,"text":"The fish twisted and turned on the bent hook.","audioSeconds":2.925,"runSeconds":0.232089345,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.232068895,"realTimeFactor":0.07934678461538462,"finite":true,"samples":70200},{"index":22,"text":"Press the pants and sew a button on the vest.","audioSeconds":3.025,"runSeconds":0.252015367,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.251974107,"realTimeFactor":0.08331086512396695,"finite":true,"samples":72600},{"index":23,"text":"The swan dive was far short of perfect.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.2194406,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.21942228,"realTimeFactor":0.07699670175438597,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":24,"text":"The beauty of the view stunned the young boy.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.212170844,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.212154814,"realTimeFactor":0.07858179407407406,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":25,"text":"Two blue fish swam in the tank.","audioSeconds":2.3,"runSeconds":0.186173825,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.186158785,"realTimeFactor":0.08094514130434782,"finite":true,"samples":55200},{"index":26,"text":"Her purse was full of useless trash.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.202068301,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.202052031,"realTimeFactor":0.07697840038095238,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":27,"text":"The colt reared and threw the tall rider.","audioSeconds":2.825,"runSeconds":0.209156076,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.209139565,"realTimeFactor":0.07403754902654866,"finite":true,"samples":67800},{"index":28,"text":"It snowed, rained, and hailed the same morning.","audioSeconds":3.05,"runSeconds":0.277865395,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.277840285,"realTimeFactor":0.09110340819672132,"finite":true,"samples":73200},{"index":29,"text":"Read verse out loud for pleasure.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.179006139,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.178993099,"realTimeFactor":0.07381696453608248,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":30,"text":"Hoist the load to your left shoulder.","audioSeconds":2.35,"runSeconds":0.190509345,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.190495665,"realTimeFactor":0.08106780638297872,"finite":true,"samples":56400},{"index":31,"text":"Take the winding path to reach the lake.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.20430497,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.20428967,"realTimeFactor":0.07783046476190476,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":32,"text":"Note closely the size of the gas tank.","audioSeconds":2.75,"runSeconds":0.215672556,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.215656875,"realTimeFactor":0.078426384,"finite":true,"samples":66000},{"index":33,"text":"Wipe the grease off his dirty face.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.179973739,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.179959639,"realTimeFactor":0.07421597484536083,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":34,"text":"Mend the coat before you go out.","audioSeconds":2.25,"runSeconds":0.185201728,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.185187907,"realTimeFactor":0.08231187911111111,"finite":true,"samples":54000},{"index":35,"text":"The wrist was badly strained and hung limp.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.221236817,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.221213777,"realTimeFactor":0.07762695333333333,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":36,"text":"The stray cat gave birth to kittens.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.198773621,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.198758341,"realTimeFactor":0.07572328419047619,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":37,"text":"The young girl gave no clear response.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.208006966,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.207990976,"realTimeFactor":0.07703961703703703,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":38,"text":"The meal was cooked before the bell rang.","audioSeconds":2.525,"runSeconds":0.197775503,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.197760493,"realTimeFactor":0.07832693188118812,"finite":true,"samples":60600},{"index":39,"text":"What joy there is in living.","audioSeconds":2.075,"runSeconds":0.161527351,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.161514061,"realTimeFactor":0.07784450650602409,"finite":true,"samples":49800},{"index":40,"text":"A king ruled the state in the early days.","audioSeconds":2.75,"runSeconds":0.218941866,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.218924056,"realTimeFactor":0.079615224,"finite":true,"samples":66000},{"index":41,"text":"The ship was torn apart on the sharp reef.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.213033493,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.213017243,"realTimeFactor":0.07890129370370369,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":42,"text":"Sickness kept him home the third week.","audioSeconds":2.5,"runSeconds":0.192222362,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.192207032,"realTimeFactor":0.0768889448,"finite":true,"samples":60000},{"index":43,"text":"The wide road shimmered in the hot sun.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.20940016,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.2093779,"realTimeFactor":0.07977148952380952,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":44,"text":"The lazy cow lay in the cool grass.","audioSeconds":2.55,"runSeconds":0.208852125,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.208835665,"realTimeFactor":0.08190279411764706,"finite":true,"samples":61200},{"index":45,"text":"Lift the square stone over the fence.","audioSeconds":2.375,"runSeconds":0.196996815,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.196981465,"realTimeFactor":0.08294602736842105,"finite":true,"samples":57000},{"index":46,"text":"The rope will bind the seven books at once.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.217398593,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.217383013,"realTimeFactor":0.07977930018348624,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":47,"text":"Hop over the fence and plunge in.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.214694029,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.214678649,"realTimeFactor":0.08853362020618558,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":48,"text":"The friendly gang left the drug store.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.203010192,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.202994262,"realTimeFactor":0.0788389095145631,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":49,"text":"Mesh wire keeps chicks inside.","audioSeconds":2.525,"runSeconds":0.189187255,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.189164495,"realTimeFactor":0.07492564554455446,"finite":true,"samples":60600},{"index":50,"text":"The frosty air passed through the coat.","audioSeconds":2.375,"runSeconds":0.193153131,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.193125821,"realTimeFactor":0.08132763410526316,"finite":true,"samples":57000},{"index":51,"text":"The crooked maze failed to fool the mouse.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.197699093,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.197684363,"realTimeFactor":0.07531394019047619,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":52,"text":"Adding fast leads to wrong sums.","audioSeconds":2.5,"runSeconds":0.210411191,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.2103888,"realTimeFactor":0.0841644764,"finite":true,"samples":60000},{"index":53,"text":"The show was a flop from the very start.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.223839852,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.223824202,"realTimeFactor":0.08214306495412844,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":54,"text":"A saw is a tool used for making boards.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.215076832,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.215059251,"realTimeFactor":0.0754655550877193,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":55,"text":"The wagon moved on well oiled wheels.","audioSeconds":2.6,"runSeconds":0.193991299,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.193974729,"realTimeFactor":0.07461203807692307,"finite":true,"samples":62400},{"index":56,"text":"March the soldiers past the next hill.","audioSeconds":2.65,"runSeconds":0.223038847,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.223023287,"realTimeFactor":0.08416560264150943,"finite":true,"samples":63600},{"index":57,"text":"A cup of sugar makes sweet fudge.","audioSeconds":2.35,"runSeconds":0.192274835,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.192258304,"realTimeFactor":0.08181907872340426,"finite":true,"samples":56400},{"index":58,"text":"Place a rosebush near the porch steps.","audioSeconds":2.6,"runSeconds":0.193158752,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.193142852,"realTimeFactor":0.07429182769230769,"finite":true,"samples":62400},{"index":59,"text":"Both lost their lives in the raging storm.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.214310496,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.214293956,"realTimeFactor":0.0751966652631579,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":60,"text":"We talked of the side show in the circus.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.25399842,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.25397971,"realTimeFactor":0.09864016310679612,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":61,"text":"Use a pencil to write the first draft.","audioSeconds":2.775,"runSeconds":0.237321348,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.237295928,"realTimeFactor":0.08552120648648648,"finite":true,"samples":66600},{"index":62,"text":"He ran half way to the hardware store.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.222633443,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.222606743,"realTimeFactor":0.08170034605504586,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":63,"text":"The clock struck to mark the third period.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.205165882,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.205149082,"realTimeFactor":0.07815843123809524,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":64,"text":"A small creek cut across the field.","audioSeconds":2.45,"runSeconds":0.189886452,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.189870932,"realTimeFactor":0.07750467428571428,"finite":true,"samples":58800},{"index":65,"text":"Cars and busses stalled in snow drifts.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.258809425,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.258792745,"realTimeFactor":0.0908103245614035,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":66,"text":"The set of china hit the floor with a crash.","audioSeconds":2.75,"runSeconds":0.220517204,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.220500234,"realTimeFactor":0.08018807418181818,"finite":true,"samples":66000},{"index":67,"text":"This is a grand season for hikes on the road.","audioSeconds":2.875,"runSeconds":0.217218694,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.217198894,"realTimeFactor":0.07555432834782608,"finite":true,"samples":69000},{"index":68,"text":"The dune rose from the edge of the water.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.19821348,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.19819801,"realTimeFactor":0.07550989714285714,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":69,"text":"Those words were the cue for the actor to leave.","audioSeconds":3.0,"runSeconds":0.2375128,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.237373889,"realTimeFactor":0.07917093333333333,"finite":true,"samples":72000},{"index":70,"text":"A yacht slid around the point into the bay.","audioSeconds":2.775,"runSeconds":0.233488314,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.233464573,"realTimeFactor":0.08413993297297298,"finite":true,"samples":66600},{"index":71,"text":"The two met while playing on the sand.","audioSeconds":2.375,"runSeconds":0.204661159,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.204645379,"realTimeFactor":0.08617311957894737,"finite":true,"samples":57000},{"index":72,"text":"The ink stain dried on the finished page.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.213470049,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.213454109,"realTimeFactor":0.07833763266055045,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":73,"text":"The walled town was seized without a fight.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.201767583,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.201752222,"realTimeFactor":0.07835634291262135,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":74,"text":"The lease ran out in sixteen weeks.","audioSeconds":2.5,"runSeconds":0.211226369,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.211211289,"realTimeFactor":0.0844905476,"finite":true,"samples":60000},{"index":75,"text":"A tame squirrel makes a nice pet.","audioSeconds":2.375,"runSeconds":0.196443224,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.196428644,"realTimeFactor":0.08271293642105264,"finite":true,"samples":57000},{"index":76,"text":"The horn of the car woke the sleeping cop.","audioSeconds":2.6,"runSeconds":0.194096902,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.194081852,"realTimeFactor":0.0746526546153846,"finite":true,"samples":62400},{"index":77,"text":"The heart beat strongly and with firm strokes.","audioSeconds":3.05,"runSeconds":0.232159021,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.232142661,"realTimeFactor":0.07611771180327868,"finite":true,"samples":73200},{"index":78,"text":"The pearl was worn in a thin silver ring.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.212847224,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.212830574,"realTimeFactor":0.07468323649122807,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":79,"text":"The fruit peel was cut in thick slices.","audioSeconds":2.75,"runSeconds":0.23417483,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.23414974,"realTimeFactor":0.08515448363636363,"finite":true,"samples":66000},{"index":80,"text":"The Navy attacked the big task force.","audioSeconds":2.65,"runSeconds":0.204143405,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.204126565,"realTimeFactor":0.07703524716981132,"finite":true,"samples":63600},{"index":81,"text":"See the cat glaring at the scared mouse.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.198060279,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.198044669,"realTimeFactor":0.07545153485714286,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":82,"text":"There are more than two factors here.","audioSeconds":2.325,"runSeconds":0.186558643,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.186542763,"realTimeFactor":0.08024027655913978,"finite":true,"samples":55800},{"index":83,"text":"The hat brim was wide and too droopy.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.224120888,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.224101478,"realTimeFactor":0.08300773629629629,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":84,"text":"The lawyer tried to lose his case.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.178307857,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.178292327,"realTimeFactor":0.07352901319587629,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":85,"text":"The grass curled around the fence post.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.201095008,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.201077538,"realTimeFactor":0.07809514873786406,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":86,"text":"Cut the pie into large parts.","audioSeconds":2.2,"runSeconds":0.161990898,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.161975428,"realTimeFactor":0.07363222636363635,"finite":true,"samples":52800},{"index":87,"text":"Men strive but seldom get rich.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.205460517,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.205442657,"realTimeFactor":0.07979049203883495,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":88,"text":"Always close the barn door tight.","audioSeconds":2.4,"runSeconds":0.178098416,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.178073016,"realTimeFactor":0.07420767333333333,"finite":true,"samples":57600},{"index":89,"text":"He lay prone and hardly moved a limb.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.214869635,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.214849534,"realTimeFactor":0.07885124220183486,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":90,"text":"The slush lay deep along the street.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.180173225,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.180155235,"realTimeFactor":0.07429823711340207,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":91,"text":"A wisp of cloud hung in the blue air.","audioSeconds":2.45,"runSeconds":0.18720271,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.18718666,"realTimeFactor":0.0764092693877551,"finite":true,"samples":58800},{"index":92,"text":"A pound of sugar costs more than eggs.","audioSeconds":2.675,"runSeconds":0.266457568,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.266436088,"realTimeFactor":0.09961030579439252,"finite":true,"samples":64200},{"index":93,"text":"The fin was sharp and cut the clear water.","audioSeconds":2.925,"runSeconds":0.224972007,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.224954057,"realTimeFactor":0.07691350666666667,"finite":true,"samples":70200},{"index":94,"text":"The play seems dull and quite stupid.","audioSeconds":2.55,"runSeconds":0.200693764,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.200676474,"realTimeFactor":0.0787034368627451,"finite":true,"samples":61200},{"index":95,"text":"Bail the boat to stop it from sinking.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.199511514,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.199493864,"realTimeFactor":0.07600438628571429,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":96,"text":"The term ended in late June that year.","audioSeconds":2.65,"runSeconds":0.22623536,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.22620596,"realTimeFactor":0.08537183396226415,"finite":true,"samples":63600},{"index":97,"text":"A tusk is used to make costly gifts.","audioSeconds":2.775,"runSeconds":0.235298943,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.235262232,"realTimeFactor":0.08479241189189189,"finite":true,"samples":66600},{"index":98,"text":"Ten pins were set in order.","audioSeconds":2.25,"runSeconds":0.1763212,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.17629851,"realTimeFactor":0.07836497777777779,"finite":true,"samples":54000},{"index":99,"text":"The bill was paid every third week.","audioSeconds":2.45,"runSeconds":0.189201409,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.189180979,"realTimeFactor":0.07722506489795918,"finite":true,"samples":58800},{"index":100,"text":"Oak is strong and also gives shade.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.20996981,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.209947459,"realTimeFactor":0.0777665962962963,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":101,"text":"Cats and dogs each hate the other.","audioSeconds":2.475,"runSeconds":0.212040849,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.212023339,"realTimeFactor":0.0856730703030303,"finite":true,"samples":59400},{"index":102,"text":"The pipe began to rust while new.","audioSeconds":2.375,"runSeconds":0.194826901,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.194809551,"realTimeFactor":0.08203237936842105,"finite":true,"samples":57000},{"index":103,"text":"Open the crate but don't break the glass.","audioSeconds":2.675,"runSeconds":0.210154943,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.210136672,"realTimeFactor":0.0785625955140187,"finite":true,"samples":64200},{"index":104,"text":"Add the sum to the product of these three.","audioSeconds":2.55,"runSeconds":0.202070978,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.202052778,"realTimeFactor":0.07924352078431374,"finite":true,"samples":61200},{"index":105,"text":"Thieves who rob friends deserve jail.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.210445865,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.210425875,"realTimeFactor":0.07794291296296296,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":106,"text":"The ripe taste of cheese improves with age.","audioSeconds":2.9,"runSeconds":0.290499992,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.290339039,"realTimeFactor":0.10017241103448275,"finite":true,"samples":69600},{"index":107,"text":"Act on these orders with great speed.","audioSeconds":2.6,"runSeconds":0.198539225,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.198511125,"realTimeFactor":0.07636124038461539,"finite":true,"samples":62400},{"index":108,"text":"The hog crawled under the high fence.","audioSeconds":2.375,"runSeconds":0.195150805,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.195133195,"realTimeFactor":0.08216876000000001,"finite":true,"samples":57000},{"index":109,"text":"Move the vat over the hot fire.","audioSeconds":2.4,"runSeconds":0.170740261,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.170724721,"realTimeFactor":0.07114177541666668,"finite":true,"samples":57600},{"index":110,"text":"The bark of the pine tree was shiny and dark.","audioSeconds":3.05,"runSeconds":0.233084154,"g2pSeconds":0.